      "message": "Thanks, refusing `XDP_UMEM_REG` up front with `p3s_4k_unsupported()` looks good to me.\n\nNit: would you mind also dropping the new `mm` local, so that `mmap_read_lock()` and `mmap_read_unlock()` keep `current-\u003emm` as upstream has them? The check on its own would be:\n\n```\n\tif (p3s_4k_unsupported(current-\u003emm))\n\t\treturn -EOPNOTSUPP;\n```\n\nThat way the patch only adds the check to `xdp_umem_pin_pages()`, and upstream changes to the pinning lines won\u0027t conflict with it.",
